{"step_index":107,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T08:28:33Z","input_tokens":3078,"cache_read_tokens":127998,"output_tokens":3367,"thinking":"Considering options for the pixel art, focusing on recognizable shapes suitable for card sorting. Evaluating a heart with a sparkle, a sword and shield, or a magic potion/crown to ensure distinct colors and easy sorting.\n\n\nExamining a pixel heart design with diamond sparkle, initial color assignments are Deep Navy, Crimson Red, Golden Yellow, and Pure White/Pink Diamond. The 8x8 grid layout is being evaluated. Discovered a potential issue with the design; if the bottom row is uniformly colored, it would cause immediate column merging, which is not desirable. Considering a revised heart filling pattern to create a more balanced bottom row for card sorting.\n\n\nThe heart design is refined with a pointed base using red and blue. Considering board layout, two or three centered holding slots at the bottom are standard. Two holding slots directly centered below columns four and five provide a clean layout.\n\nEnhancing visual quality with card dimensions, rounded corners, solid colors, shadows, and top highlights enhances the game's tactility. The table background is dark green felt with radial glow and wood trim. Dashed card outlines enhance the visual organization of each column and slot.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"Content":"import os\nfrom PIL import Image, ImageDraw, ImageFont\n\nWIDTH = 840\nHEIGHT = 760\n\nCARD_W = 76\nCARD_H = 100\nCARD_STEP_Y = 36\nCOL_GAP = 14\n\nLEFT_MARGIN = int((WIDTH - (8 * CARD_W + 7 * COL_GAP)) / 2)\nSTART_Y = 100\n\n# 8x8 Pixel Heart Matrix\n# R: Red, B: Navy Blue, Y: Gold/Yellow, W: White/Diamond Shine\nPIXEL_GRID = [\n    ['B', 'R', 'R', 'B', 'B', 'R', 'R', 'B'],  # Row 0 (Top)\n    ['R', 'W', 'W', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R'],  # Row 1\n    ['R', 'W', 'Y', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R'],  # Row 2\n    ['R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R'],  # Row 3\n    ['R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R'],  # Row 4\n    ['B', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'B'],  # Row 5\n    ['B', 'B', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'R', 'B', 'B'],  # Row 6\n    ['B', 'B', 'B', 'R', 'R', 'B', 'B', 'B']   # Row 7 (Bottom / Movable cards!)\n]\n\nCOLOR_PALETTE = {\n    'R': {'fill': (239, 68, 68), 'border': (185, 28, 28), 'highlight': (252, 165, 165)},\n    'B': {'fill': (37, 99, 235), 'border': (29, 78, 216), 'highlight': (147, 197, 253)},\n    'Y': {'fill': (245, 158, 11), 'border': (180, 83, 9), 'highlight': (253, 230, 138)},\n    'W': {'fill': (248, 250, 252), 'border': (203, 213, 225), 'highlight': (255, 255, 255)}\n}\n\n# 1. Base Image: Felt Table & Dark Green Canvas\nimg = Image.new('RGB', (WIDTH, HEIGHT), '#06170d')\ndraw = ImageDraw.Draw(img)\n\n# Felt table board with subtle wood-bevel border\ndraw.rounded_rectangle([14, 14, WIDTH - 14, HEIGHT - 14], radius=32, fill='#114b29', outline='#082614', width=6)\ndraw.rounded_rectangle([20, 20, WIDTH - 20, HEIGHT - 20], radius=28, fill='#145a32', outline='#0d3d22', width=2)\n\n# Top Bar Header\ndraw.text((36, 36), \"PIXEL ART CARD SORT\", fill='#fef08a')\ndraw.text((36, 56), \"8 × 8 Grid · 64 Lá bài đơn sắc xếp đè tạo hình Heart Pixel\", fill='#86efac')\n\n# Right side controls\ndraw.rounded_rectangle([WIDTH - 210, 34, WIDTH - 36, 68], radius=16, fill='#0a2e18', outline='#ffffff33', width=1)\ndraw.text((WIDTH - 195, 43), \"8 Cột  |  2 Free Slots\", fill='#fef9c3')\n\n# Column base placeholders\nfor col_idx in range(8):\n    col_x = LEFT_MARGIN + col_idx * (CARD_W + COL_GAP)\n    draw.rounded_rectangle([col_x, START_Y, col_x + CARD_W, START_Y + CARD_H], radius=8, fill='#0d3d22', outline='#ffffff25', width=2)\n\n# Function to draw card with 3D physical shading\ndef draw_card(col_x, card_y, color_key, is_bottom=False):\n    c = COLOR_PALETTE[color_key]\n    # Drop shadow\n    shadow_offset = 5 if is_bottom else 3\n    draw.rounded_rectangle(\n        [col_x + 2, card_y + shadow_offset, col_x + CARD_W + 2, card_y + CARD_H + shadow_offset],\n        radius=8, fill=(0, 0, 0, 90)\n    )\n    # Card Body\n    draw.rounded_rectangle(\n        [col_x, card_y, col_x + CARD_W, card_y + CARD_H],\n        radius=8, fill=c['fill'], outline=c['border'], width=2\n    )\n    # Subtle inner bevel highlight on top edge\n    draw.line([col_x + 6, card_y + 3, col_x + CARD_W - 6, card_y + 3], fill=c['highlight'], width=1)\n\n# Draw all overlapping cards row by row (Row 0 at back to Row 7 in front)\nfor row_idx in range(8):\n    for col_idx in range(8):\n        color_key = PIXEL_GRID[row_idx][col_idx]\n        col_x = LEFT_MARGIN + col_idx * (CARD_W + COL_GAP)\n        card_y = START_Y + row_idx * CARD_STEP_Y\n        is_bottom = (row_idx == 7)\n        draw_card(col_x, card_y, color_key, is_bottom=is_bottom)\n\n# Draw Holding Slots Area at the Bottom Center\nSLOT_AREA_Y = START_Y + 7 * CARD_STEP_Y + CARD_H + 32\nslot_center_x = WIDTH // 2\n\n# Label for Holding Slots\ndraw.text((slot_center_x - 145, SLOT_AREA_Y - 22), \"SLOT TẠM (FREE CELLS - Nhận 1 quân khi không có cột trùng)\", fill='#bbf7d0')\n\n# Slot 1: Empty placeholder\nslot1_x = slot_center_x - CARD_W - 12\ndraw.rounded_rectangle([slot1_x, SLOT_AREA_Y, slot1_x + CARD_W, SLOT_AREA_Y + CARD_H], radius=8, fill='#0c381f', outline='#ffffff44', width=2)\ndraw.text((slot1_x + 18, SLOT_AREA_Y + 42), \"TRỐNG\", fill='#ffffff55')\n\n# Slot 2: Holding 1 Blue card\nslot2_x = slot_center_x + 12\ndraw.rounded_rectangle([slot2_x, SLOT_AREA_Y, slot2_x + CARD_W, SLOT_AREA_Y + CARD_H], radius=8, fill='#0c381f', outline='#ffffff44', width=2)\ndraw_card(slot2_x, SLOT_AREA_Y, 'B', is_bottom=True)\n\n# Indicator note at bottom\ndraw.text((36, HEIGHT - 46), \"• Chạm 1 cột để bốc các quân đáy cùng màu  • Ưu tiên cột cùng màu  • Đủ 8 lá thuần màu sẽ Clear cột!\", fill='#86efac')\n\n# Save Output Image\noutput_path = r'C:\\Users\\Admin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8\\pixel_art_card_sort_8x8.png'\nimg.save(output_path, quality=95)\nprint(f\"SUCCESS: Generated image at {output_path}\")\nprint(f\"Size: {os.path.getsize(output_path)} bytes\")\n","Path":"C:\\Users\\Admin\\.gemini\\antigravity\\brain\\0ca39d47-bf1d-4d04-97dc-9c2fe64cb8c8\\create_pixel_art_demo.py"}}]}
