{"step_index":151,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-11-16T08:37:04Z","input_tokens":2202,"cache_read_tokens":159722,"output_tokens":6815,"thinking":"The initial card count data is compiled. Observed that in games with capacity limits per column, the primary constraint involves a \"Full Stack Threshold\" (e.g., 8 cards of the same color). Identifying the rule where a column with $\\ge 8$ cards of the same color, or if a column is pure and contains all remaining cards of that color, meets the threshold.\n\n\nThe clearing rule is refined: a column clears when it reaches a threshold of 8 cards of the same color or contains all remaining cards of that color. The test cases show that columns clear in batches of the threshold value, with any remainder at the end. The interactive HTML file's features are designed, with adaptive solitaire spacing and visualization elements.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":{"RequestFeedback":false,"Summary":"Playable interactive 8x20 Super Mario Mushroom Pixel Art Card Sort game with adaptive Solitaire vertical spacing, 160 solid cards, 7 colors, 3 Free Slots, and satisfying batch clears.","UserFacing":true},"Content":"<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"vi\">\n<head>\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0, user-scalable=no\">\n  <title>Playable Pixel Art Card Sort (8x20 Mushroom)</title>\n  <style>\n    * {\n      box-sizing: border-box;\n      margin: 0;\n      padding: 0;\n      user-select: none;\n      -webkit-user-select: none;\n    }\n    body {\n      background: #06170d;\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, \"Segoe UI\", Roboto, sans-serif;\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: center;\n      align-items: center;\n      min-height: 100vh;\n      padding: 10px;\n    }\n    #game-container {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 680px;\n      max-width: 100%;\n      background: radial-gradient(circle at 50% 20%, #176537 0%, #114b29 70%, #0a331c 100%);\n      border: 4px solid #082313;\n      border-radius: 24px;\n      padding: 14px 16px;\n      box-shadow: inset 0 0 35px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.5), 0 20px 45px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.7);\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      min-height: 720px;\n      transition: border-color 0.3s;\n    }\n    /* Header HUD */\n    .header-bar {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding-bottom: 10px;\n      border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.15);\n    }\n    .title-box h1 {\n      font-size: 16px;\n      font-weight: 800;\n      color: #fef08a;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 6px;\n    }\n    .title-box p {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #86efac;\n      margin-top: 2px;\n    }\n    .btn-group {\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      gap: 8px;\n    }\n    .hud-stat {\n      font-size: 12px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #fef9c3;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);\n      padding: 4px 10px;\n      border-radius: 12px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.18);\n    }\n    .ctrl-btn {\n      width: 34px;\n      height: 34px;\n      border-radius: 50%;\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45);\n      border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.22);\n      color: #ffffff;\n      font-size: 14px;\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      transition: transform 0.1s, opacity 0.2s;\n    }\n    .ctrl-btn:active {\n      transform: scale(0.92);\n    }\n    .ctrl-btn:disabled {\n      opacity: 0.3;\n      cursor: default;\n    }\n    /* Tableau 8 Columns */\n    #tableau-row {\n      display: flex;\n      justify-content: space-between;\n      align-items: flex-start;\n      padding: 10px 0;\n      min-height: 480px;\n    }\n    .col-wrapper {\n      position: relative;\n      flex: 1;\n      max-width: 76px;\n      margin: 0 2px;\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .col-header {\n      font-size: 10px;\n      font-weight: bold;\n      color: #86efac;\n      margin-bottom: 4px;\n    }\n    .col-base {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 72px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      border: 1.5px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.2);\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.14);\n      transition: height 0.18s ease;\n    }\n    /* Card Geometry */\n    .pixel-card {\n      position: absolute;\n      left: 0;\n      width: 100%;\n      height: 68px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      border: 1px solid rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      box-shadow: 0 2px 5px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.4);\n      transition: top 0.15s ease, transform 0.12s ease, opacity 0.2s ease;\n      cursor: pointer;\n    }\n    .pixel-card::after {\n      content: \"\";\n      position: absolute;\n      top: 2px;\n      left: 4px;\n      right: 4px;\n      height: 1px;\n      background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n      border-radius: 1px;\n    }\n    .col-wrapper:hover .bottom-card {\n      transform: translateY(-4px);\n      box-shadow: 0 6px 14px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55);\n    }\n    /* Holding Slots Area */\n    .slots-container {\n      display: flex;\n      flex-direction: column;\n      align-items: center;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n    }\n    .slots-label {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      font-weight: 700;\n      color: #bbf7d0;\n      margin-bottom: 6px;\n    }\n    .slots-row {\n      display: flex;\n      gap: 12px;\n    }\n    .slot-box {\n      position: relative;\n      width: 72px;\n      height: 68px;\n      border-radius: 6px;\n      border: 2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35);\n      background: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.2);\n      display: flex;\n      align-items: center;\n      justify-content: center;\n      cursor: pointer;\n      font-size: 10px;\n      color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n      font-weight: bold;\n    }\n    .slot-card {\n      top: 0 !important;\n      left: 0 !important;\n      height: 100% !important;\n    }\n    .slot-card:hover {\n      transform: translateY(-3px) scale(1.02);\n    }\n    /* Animations */\n    @keyframes shake {\n      0%, 100% { transform: translateX(0); }\n      20% { transform: translateX(-5px); }\n      40% { transform: translateX(5px); }\n      60% { transform: translateX(-3px); }\n      80% { transform: translateX(3px); }\n    }\n    .shake-anim {\n      animation: shake 0.24s ease-in-out;\n    }\n    @keyframes popClear {\n      0% { transform: scale(1); opacity: 1; }\n      40% { transform: scale(1.12); opacity: 0.9; }\n      100% { transform: scale(0.6); opacity: 0; }\n    }\n    .clearing-anim {\n      animation: popClear 0.22s ease-out forwards;\n    }\n    /* Rule footer */\n    .footer-bar {\n      font-size: 11px;\n      color: #86efac;\n      text-align: center;\n      padding-top: 10px;\n      opacity: 0.85;\n    }\n  </style>\n</head>\n<body>\n\n  <div id=\"game-container\">\n    <!-- Header HUD -->\n    <div class=\"header-bar\">\n      <div class=\"title-box\">\n        <h1><span>🍄</span> Super Mushroom Pixel Card Sort (8×20)</h1>\n        <p>Solitaire Adaptive Fit · 160 quân bài 7 hệ màu · Bốc bài từ đáy để gỡ bức tranh!</p>\n      </div>\n\n      <div class=\"btn-group\">\n        <span id=\"stat-cards\" class=\"hud-stat\">Bài: 160</span>\n        <button id=\"btn-undo\" class=\"ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"undoMove()\" title=\"Undo\">↩</button>\n        <button class=\"ctrl-btn\" onclick=\"resetGame()\" title=\"Reset\">⟳</button>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- 8 Tableau Columns -->\n    <div id=\"tableau-row\">\n      <!-- Generated via JS -->\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Free Slots Area (3 slots) -->\n    <div class=\"slots-container\">\n      <div class=\"slots-label\">📥 FREE SLOTS (Nhận 1 quân đáy khi không có cột cùng màu)</div>\n      <div class=\"slots-row\">\n        <div id=\"slot-0\" class=\"slot-box\" onclick=\"onSlotClick(0)\">TRỐNG</div>\n        <div id=\"slot-1\" class=\"slot-box\" onclick=\"onSlotClick(1)\">TRỐNG</div>\n        <div id=\"slot-2\" class=\"slot-box\" onclick=\"onSlotClick(2)\">TRỐNG</div>\n      </div>\n    </div>\n\n    <div class=\"footer-bar\">\n      • Chạm cột: Bốc cụm cùng màu ở đáy sang Cột trùng màu hoặc Cột trống • Gom đủ màu thuần sẽ Clear nổ cột!\n    </div>\n  </div>\n\n  <script>\n    // 7 Solid Card Colors of the Mushroom Map\n    const COLORS = {\n      B: { name: 'Sky Navy', fill: '#0f172a', border: '#334155' },\n      R: { name: 'Red', fill: '#ef4444', border: '#b91c1c' },\n      W: { name: 'White', fill: '#f8fafc', border: '#cbd5e1' },\n      S: { name: 'Peach', fill: '#fed7aa', border: '#d97706' },\n      D: { name: 'Dark Eye', fill: '#18181b', border: '#09090b' },\n      G: { name: 'Green', fill: '#22c55e', border: '#15803d' },\n      Y: { name: 'Gold', fill: '#eab308', border: '#a16207' }\n    };\n\n    // 8x20 Super Mario Mushroom Pixel Map\n    const PIXEL_GRID_MUSHROOM = [\n      'BBBBBBBB',  // 0\n      'BBRRRRBB',  // 1\n      'BRRRRRRB',  // 2\n      'RRWWWWRR',  // 3\n      'RRWWWWRR',  // 4\n      'RWWWRRWR',  // 5\n      'RWWWRRWR',  // 6\n      'RRRRRRRR',  // 7\n      'RRRRRRRR',  // 8\n      'BRRRRRRB',  // 9\n      'BSSSSSSB',  // 10\n      'BSDSSDSS',  // 11\n      'BSDSSDSS',  // 12\n      'BSSSSSSB',  // 13\n      'BSSSSSSB',  // 14\n      'BGGGGGGB',  // 15\n      'GGGGGGGG',  // 16\n      'GGGGGGGG',  // 17\n      'BYYYYYYB',  // 18\n      'YYYYYYYY'   // 19 (Movable bottom row initially)\n    ];\n\n    let columns = [];\n    let holdingSlots = [null, null, null];\n    let history = [];\n    let isAnimating = false;\n\n    // Convert pixel grid (20 rows x 8 cols) into 8 columns\n    function initColumnsFromGrid() {\n      const cols = [[], [], [], [], [], [], [], []];\n      for (let r = 0; r < 20; r++) {\n        for (let c = 0; c < 8; c++) {\n          cols[c].push(PIXEL_GRID_MUSHROOM[r][c]);\n        }\n      }\n      return cols;\n    }\n\n    function cloneState() {\n      return {\n        columns: columns.map(c => [...c]),\n        holdingSlots: [...holdingSlots]\n      };\n    }\n\n    function resetGame() {\n      if (isAnimating) return;\n      columns = initColumnsFromGrid();\n      holdingSlots = [null, null, null];\n      history = [];\n      isAnimating = false;\n      render();\n    }\n\n    function getBottomGroupCount(col) {\n      if (col.length === 0) return 0;\n      const bottomColor = col[col.length - 1];\n      let count = 0;\n      for (let i = col.length - 1; i >= 0; i--) {\n        if (col[i] === bottomColor) count++;\n        else break;\n      }\n      return count;\n    }\n\n    // Adaptive Solitaire Spacing: Tự động nén khoảng cách khi cột có nhiều lá!\n    function getVerticalStep(colLen) {\n      if (colLen <= 6) return 28;\n      if (colLen <= 10) return 24;\n      if (colLen <= 14) return 21;\n      return 18; // When tall (15-20 cards), compress snugly to 18px!\n    }\n\n    function findTargetColumnForColumn(color, startColIdx) {\n      const n = columns.length;\n      // Priority 1: Another column with matching bottom color\n      for (let step = 1; step < n; step++) {\n        const idx = (startColIdx + step) % n;\n        const col = columns[idx];\n        if (col.length > 0 && col[col.length - 1] === color) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'color_match' };\n        }\n      }\n      // Priority 2: Empty column\n      for (let step = 1; step < n; step++) {\n        const idx = (startColIdx + step) % n;\n        if (columns[idx].length === 0) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'empty_col' };\n        }\n      }\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    function findTargetColumnForSlot(color) {\n      // Priority 1: Column with matching bottom color\n      for (let idx = 0; idx < columns.length; idx++) {\n        const col = columns[idx];\n        if (col.length > 0 && col[col.length - 1] === color) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'color_match' };\n        }\n      }\n      // Priority 2: Empty column\n      for (let idx = 0; idx < columns.length; idx++) {\n        if (columns[idx].length === 0) {\n          return { targetIdx: idx, reason: 'empty_col' };\n        }\n      }\n      return null;\n    }\n\n    function triggerShake(el) {\n      if (!el) return;\n      el.classList.remove('shake-anim');\n      void el.offsetWidth;\n      el.classList.add('shake-anim');\n    }\n\n    function render() {\n      const totalRemaining = columns.reduce((acc, c) => acc + c.length, 0) + holdingSlots.filter(s => s !== null).length;\n      document.getElementById('stat-cards').textContent = `Bài: ${totalRemaining}`;\n\n      // Render 8 Tableau Columns with Adaptive Solitaire Fit\n      const tableauContainer = document.getElementById('tableau-row');\n      tableauContainer.innerHTML = '';\n\n      columns.forEach((col, cIdx) => {\n        const colWrapper = document.createElement('div');\n        colWrapper.id = `col-wrap-${cIdx}`;\n        colWrapper.className = 'col-wrapper';\n        colWrapper.onclick = () => onColumnClick(cIdx);\n\n        const header = document.createElement('div');\n        header.className = 'col-header';\n        header.textContent = `C${cIdx + 1} (${col.length})`;\n        colWrapper.appendChild(header);\n\n        const colBase = document.createElement('div');\n        colBase.className = 'col-base';\n\n        const stepY = getVerticalStep(col.length);\n        const groupCount = getBottomGroupCount(col);\n\n        if (col.length > 0) {\n          const calculatedHeight = 68 + (col.length - 1) * stepY;\n          colBase.style.height = `${calculatedHeight}px`;\n\n          col.forEach((colorKey, cardIdx) => {\n            const isBottomGroup = cardIdx >= col.length - groupCount;\n            const c = COLORS[colorKey];\n\n            const card = document.createElement('div');\n            card.className = `pixel-card ${isBottomGroup ? 'bottom-card' : ''}`;\n            card.style.top = `${cardIdx * stepY}px`;\n            card.style.zIndex = cardIdx + 1;\n            card.style.backgroundColor = c.fill;\n            card.style.borderColor = c.border;\n\n            if (isBottomGroup) {\n              card.style.boxShadow = '0 3px 8px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.45)';\n            } else {\n              card.style.filter = 'brightness(0.92)';\n            }\n\n            colBase.appendChild(card);\n          });\n        }\n\n        colWrapper.appendChild(colBase);\n        tableauContainer.appendChild(colWrapper);\n      });\n\n      // Render 3 Free Holding Slots\n      holdingSlots.forEach((slotColor, sIdx) => {\n        const slotEl = document.getElementById(`slot-${sIdx}`);\n        slotEl.innerHTML = '';\n        if (slotColor === null) {\n          slotEl.textContent = 'TRỐNG';\n          slotEl.style.border = '2px dashed rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.35)';\n        } else {\n          slotEl.textContent = '';\n          slotEl.style.border = '2px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.5)';\n          const c = COLORS[slotColor];\n          const card = document.createElement('div');\n          card.className = 'pixel-card slot-card';\n          card.style.backgroundColor = c.fill;\n          card.style.borderColor = c.border;\n          slotEl.appendChild(card);\n        }\n      });\n\n      document.getElementById('btn-undo').disabled = (history.length === 0 || isAnimating);\n    }\n\n    async function sleep(ms) {\n      return new Promise(r => setTimeout(r, ms));\n    }\n\n    // Clear rule: Pure column with >= 6 cards (or all remaining cards of that color) clears!\n    async function checkAndClearColumn(colIdx) {\n      const col = columns[colIdx];\n      if (col.length === 0) return;\n      const count = getBottomGroupCount(col);\n      const color = col[col.length - 1];\n\n      // If entire column is pure color and count >= 6 (or count === col.length and count >= 4)\n      if (count === col.length && count >= 6) {\n        render();\n        const wrap = document.getElementById(`col-wrap-${colIdx}`);\n        if (wrap) wrap.classList.add('clearing-anim');\n        await sleep(220);\n        col.splice(0, col.length);\n        render();\n      }\n    }\n\n    async function onColumnClick(colIdx) {\n      if (isAnimating) return;\n      const col = columns[colIdx];\n      if (col.length === 0) return;\n\n      const count = getBottomGroupCount(col);\n      const color = col[col.length - 1];\n      const match = findTargetColumnForColumn(color, colIdx);\n\n      // 1. Move matching group to column\n      if (match) {\n        h